# Analytics (Permanent)

## Law

Product metrics (page views, PDF downloads) live in **`analytics_events`**, not `audit_events`.

| Store | Role |
| --- | --- |
| PostgreSQL `analytics_events` | Durable event rows (+ optional rollups on `documents`) |
| Redis / BullMQ `analytics.ingest` | Async ingest — never block public HTML/PDF paths |
| Audit log | Security/workflow only — see `15-audit-events.mdc` |

## Privacy

- Do **not** store raw IP, full User-Agent, emails, or share tokens.
- Optional coarse fields only: `country` (ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 from trusted proxy header), `device` (`desktop`\|`mobile`\|`tablet`\|`bot`\|`unknown`).
- Install opt-out: `ANALYTICS_ENABLED=false` disables enqueue (document in `docs/deploy/`).

## Event kinds / sources

| `kind` | `source` |
| --- | --- |
| `view` | `web_publish`, `share_web` |
| `download` | `share_pdf`, `export_download` |

## Gates

- Dashboard: JWT + membership + `@RequirePermission(audit.read)` (OWNER/ADMIN)
- Public/export writers: fire-and-forget enqueue only

## API

- `GET /api/businesses/:businessId/analytics/summary`
